  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on the Strategic Development Plan IV of NASFAM, the overall objective is to transition the NASFAM system into an aligned, sustainable enterprise that delivers measurable value in climate sensitive livelihoods (food secuirty and income) improvement of over 130,000 smallholder farmer members and their households (that includes women, youths and PWDs). NASFAM also acts as an off-taker for smallholder farmers by offering better prices and processes corn/soy blend for school feeding (nutrition)</narrative>
